        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ip9mSomTllv_x-m5Yaj6-250" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(31, 35, 40); font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;扩展检索框架&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="211" x="1156" y="6180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ip9mSomTllv_x-m5Yaj6-251" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(31, 35, 40); font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;通过&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;Monaspace Neon&amp;quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &amp;quot;SF Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; tab-size: 4; white-space: break-spaces; background-color: rgba(129, 139, 152, 0.12); border-radius: 6px; margin: 0px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; color: rgb(31, 35, 40); text-align: start;&quot;&gt;enable_mqe&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(31, 35, 40); font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;和&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;Monaspace Neon&amp;quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &amp;quot;SF Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; tab-size: 4; white-space: break-spaces; background-color: rgba(129, 139, 152, 0.12); border-radius: 6px; margin: 0px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; color: rgb(31, 35, 40); text-align: start;&quot;&gt;enable_hyde&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(31, 35, 40); font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;参数让用户可以根据具体场景选择启用哪些策略&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="620" x="1437" y="6180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ip9mSomTllv_x-m5Yaj6-252" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(31, 35, 40); font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;核心机制是&quot;扩展-检索-合并&quot;三步流程&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="400" x="1437" y="6270" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ip9mSomTllv_x-m5Yaj6-253" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(31, 35, 40); font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;MQE擅长处理用词多样性问题，HyDE擅长处理语义鸿沟问题，而统一框架则确保了结果的质量和多样性&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="731" x="1156" y="6370" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
